        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Walking the Streets of Moscow\n- Honors: People's Artist of the USSR\n- People: Rolan Bykov, Vladimir Basov, Lev Durov, Inna Churikova\n- Places: Soviet Union\n\nFacts:\n- People's Artist of the USSR was an honorary title granted to artists of the Soviet Union.\n- People's Artist of the USSR is also sometimes translated as National Artist of the USSR.\n- The film Walking the Streets of Moscow features cameos by Rolan Bykov, Vladimir Basov, Lev Durov, and Inna Churikova.\n- Rolan Bykov, Vladimir Basov, Lev Durov, and Inna Churikova were People's Artists of the USSR.",
